Panel cointegration and stationarity tests with structural breaks and common factors
----------------------

Description
-----------

^xtpunitcoint^ Panel cointegration and stationarity tests with structural breaks and common factors.
     
Examples
--------

 . ^xtset xtset xtset_^
 . ^xtpcointegwe xtpunitcoint xtpunitcoint_^
 . ^xtpcointegboot xtpunitcoint xtpunitcoint_^
 . ^xtpkpss xtpunitcoint^

